{
  "id": "the-simpsons---7x02---radioactive-man",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 7x02 - Radioactive Man",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 7x02 - Radioactive Man.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T21:02:54.825Z",
  "lineCount": 287,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The Simpsons",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3903,
      "endMs": 7202
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 15415,
      "endMs": 17508
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Oh, all these new superheroes suck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 42042,
      "endMs": 44909
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "None of them could hold a candle to Radioactive Man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 45011,
      "endMs": 47070
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The only decent new one is Radiation Dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47180,
      "endMs": 50411
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He's a cheap imitation of Radioactive Man. Explain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 50517,
      "endMs": 53145
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "The similarities are subtle, but many.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53253,
      "endMs": 55915
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "For example, Radioactive Man has his famous catchphrase, \"Up and Atom!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56022,
      "endMs": 60015
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "With \"at 'em\" spelled A-T-O-M, in a delicious pun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 60126,
      "endMs": 63027
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Go on. While Radiation Dude has a similar... but lamer catchphrase, \"Up and let's go!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 63129,
      "endMs": 69802
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "So you kids fancy yourselves experts, eh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 69903,
      "endMs": 72394
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Well, between us we've read all 814 issues of Radioactive Man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72505,
      "endMs": 76908
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Yeah, and we both have a special, limited-edition issue... where he and Fallout Boy get killed on every page.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77010,
      "endMs": 82375
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I suppose you know then, that Hollywood is planning... a feature film about Radioactive Man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82482,
      "endMs": 86719
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "I have got to do something... about that air conditioner suction.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86820,
      "endMs": 90722
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Who's gonna play Radioactive Man?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90824,
      "endMs": 92815
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I will tell you in exactly seven minutes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92926,
      "endMs": 96089
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Okay. Here we are. Alt dot nerd dot obsessive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100333,
      "endMs": 104667
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Need know star R.M. pic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104771,
      "endMs": 108263
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Yeah, I don't see why Rainier Wolfcastle should be the star.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124124,
      "endMs": 127423
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "I think we should bring back Dirk Richter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127527,
      "endMs": 130189
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Kids will want to see the original Radioactive Man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130296,
      "endMs": 133390
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "I keep telling you, he's 73 years old and he's dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133500,
      "endMs": 137596
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Granted, but- Besides, we want to stay as far away from... the campy '70s version as possible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137704,
      "endMs": 142700
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Billowing backpacks, Radioactive Man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144444,
      "endMs": 146503
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "It's the worst villain of them all! The Scoutmaster!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146613,
      "endMs": 150344
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "I see him, Fallout Boy. Go get 'em, Scouts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150450,
      "endMs": 153908
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Don't be afraid to use your nails, boys!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162395,
      "endMs": 166388
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "So, where can we shoot this picture?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189522,
      "endMs": 192821
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "We need a city that has a nuclear reactor and a gorge... and can guarantee us the full cooperation of city officials.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192926,
      "endMs": 198987
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I'll check Variety.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199098,
      "endMs": 201328
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Wow. Look at that ad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204103,
      "endMs": 206094
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "All right, this place must be hot. They don't need a big ad...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208408,
      "endMs": 211104
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "or even correct spelling. I agree with that logic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 211211,
      "endMs": 213805
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Get me two plane tickets to the state that Springfield is in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213913,
      "endMs": 216711
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Right. We have $30 million to spend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218818,
      "endMs": 221412
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "We'll blow up our dams, destroy forests- anything!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221521,
      "endMs": 224115
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "If there's a species of animal that's causing you problems... nosing around your camera, we'll have it wiped out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224224,
      "endMs": 229318
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Look, we just want to make movies, not kill things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229429,
      "endMs": 232694
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Right. We understand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232799,
      "endMs": 235791
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Students, I have an announcement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235902,
      "endMs": 238166
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "One of your favorite comic book heroes, \"Radio Man\"- Radioactive Man, stupid!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238271,
      "endMs": 243304
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Strange. I shouldn't have been able to hear that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243409,
      "endMs": 245934
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Anyway, a Hollywood studio has decided to film... the Radioactive Man movie here in Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246045,
      "endMs": 251707
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "And, they will be holding auditions to find a local youngster... to play Fallout Boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254087,
      "endMs": 259216
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Oh, and the air conditioner will be fixed this afternoon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 259325,
      "endMs": 261793
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Look behind you, Radioactive Man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 268268,
      "endMs": 270236
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "The sun is exploding again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270336,
      "endMs": 272236
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Bart, why are you talking like that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272338,
      "endMs": 274738
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Yeah, and who the hell are you talkin' to?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 274841,
      "endMs": 277071
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Marge, do you have other men in this house? Radioactive men?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 277176,
      "endMs": 280805
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "I'm practicing my Fallout Boy dialogue.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280913,
      "endMs": 283143
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "If I get his role, I could finally come to terms... with this funny little muddle called Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283249,
      "endMs": 287219
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Ev-er-y-one is... talk-ing a-bout...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298998,
      "endMs": 302331
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Ra-di-o-ac-tive M-an... y'all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302435,
      "endMs": 307598
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Wow! You mean, you were one of the original Little Rascals?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307707,
      "endMs": 310175
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Yeah. Which one were you? The ugly one?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 310276,
      "endMs": 312972
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Were you the ugly one? No, I was the tough kid. Smelly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315081,
      "endMs": 319484
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "My shtick was lookin' into an exhaust pipe and gettin' a face full of soot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319585,
      "endMs": 322713
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Nobody could do that better than me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322822,
      "endMs": 324790
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Of course, it was kinda hard to think of reasons... for me to look in that exhaust pipe every time... but, you know, we had good writers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 324891,
      "endMs": 330928
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "William Faulkner can write an exhaust pipe gag that would really make you think.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331030,
      "endMs": 333965
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "If you were such a big shot, why aren't you still makin' movies?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334067,
      "endMs": 337696
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Moe? Moe!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339505,
      "endMs": 341473
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Oh, no! My favorite aggie! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345812,
      "endMs": 347780
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Ha?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347880,
      "endMs": 349745
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Hmm? Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349849,
      "endMs": 352181
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "You stole my bit! You-That's my bit, you- Oh, you stole my bit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352285,
      "endMs": 357489
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Cut.! Oh, my God.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357590,
      "endMs": 359558
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "He's killed the original Alfalfa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 359659,
      "endMs": 361957
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Yeah. Luckily, Alfalfa was an orphan, owned by the studio.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 362061,
      "endMs": 365360
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Oh, I see. Yeah. That makes sense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365465,
      "endMs": 367524
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "With wealthy Hollywood people on the way... local merchants can be forgiven for raising their prices a little.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367633,
      "endMs": 373496
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Help me, Radioactive Man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 384951,
      "endMs": 387146
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Watch out, Radioactive Man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387253,
      "endMs": 389653
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Totally awesome. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 391758,
      "endMs": 394386
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "It's all in the delivery. \"Now is the winter of our discontent\"- Oh, no! Run!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394494,
      "endMs": 400164
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Cool! Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400266,
      "endMs": 403235
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Mom! Don't make me do this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 403336,
      "endMs": 406669
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "I don't wanna be an actor. Nonsense. You're going to be great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 406773,
      "endMs": 411005
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Now take off those glasses, so they can see your beautiful eyes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411110,
      "endMs": 415342
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "At last the world is safe, eh, Fallout Boy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417250,
      "endMs": 420913
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Watch out! Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 421020,
      "endMs": 422510
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Ha-ha! Hey, that hurts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424757,
      "endMs": 429023
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "No wonder no one came to my birthday party.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 429128,
      "endMs": 431995
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "At last the world is safe...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433466,
      "endMs": 435525
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "eh, Fallout Boy? What's for lunch tomorrow?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435635,
      "endMs": 438468
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Next. Chicken necks?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438571,
      "endMs": 440903
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "We're never going to find-Wait a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 441007,
      "endMs": 443339
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "That child has the exact qualities we're looking for.! He's perfect.! What is his name?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 443443,
      "endMs": 447436
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I don't know. He just came along with one of the others.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447547,
      "endMs": 449606
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "He didn't sign up officially. Oh, forget him then.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449715,
      "endMs": 452275
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "It wouldn't be fair to the other children who filled out their application forms in full.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452385,
      "endMs": 455946
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456055,
      "endMs": 458387
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "At last the world is safe, eh, Fallout Boy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458491,
      "endMs": 461949
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Watch out, Radioactive Man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462995,
      "endMs": 464929
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Brilliant reading. Again? Watch out, Radioactive Man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465031,
      "endMs": 469161
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Fantastic! One more time!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469268,
      "endMs": 471202
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Watch out, Radioactive Man! Congratulations, Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471304,
      "endMs": 475900
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "You're our new Fallout Boy.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476008,
      "endMs": 477908
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "That's what I'd be saying to you if you weren't an inch too short. Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478010,
      "endMs": 480979
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I've got to grow an inch by tomorrow, or I won't get that part.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485651,
      "endMs": 489678
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Pull, you mighty stallions, pull! Show me no mercy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489789,
      "endMs": 492952
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497063,
      "endMs": 498724
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Oh, I only grew half an inch. I'm still too short.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509408,
      "endMs": 512900
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Growing half an inch in one day is still pretty good, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513012,
      "endMs": 515845
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Yeah, that's how fast Grampa's shrinking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515948,
      "endMs": 518109
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Oh, I'm as tall as I ever was.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 518217,
      "endMs": 520242
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Is there any way I can look taller without actually being taller?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520353,
      "endMs": 523618
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Good news, gentlemen. I've grown that extra inch you wanted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528928,
      "endMs": 532261
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Plus several feet more. We found our new Fallout Boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532365,
      "endMs": 535766
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "And he's right over there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535868,
      "endMs": 537529
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537637,
      "endMs": 538604
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen... meet America's new Fallout Boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538704,
      "endMs": 542706
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Out of the way. Milhouse, baby!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547747,
      "endMs": 550181
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Lionel Hutz, your new agent, bodyguard, unauthorized biographer and drug dealer- uh, keeper-awayer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550283,
      "endMs": 556379
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Leave me alone! Mom! Dad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559292,
      "endMs": 562625
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Make 'em stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562728,
      "endMs": 564696
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "What is all this stuff? Uh, we've heard you've become a star.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567800,
      "endMs": 571361
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "We decided we better start living in the fast lane.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571470,
      "endMs": 574030
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "What if I'm not a success? How will you pay for all this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574140,
      "endMs": 577735
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "I'm sorry. I can't hear you, son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577843,
      "endMs": 580334
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "I'm wearing a Jacuzzi suit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580446,
      "endMs": 582437
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "I just missed out... on the greatest opportunity of my entire life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583449,
      "endMs": 588477
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "George Burns was right. Show business is a hideous bitch goddess.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588588,
      "endMs": 592752
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Cheer up, Bart. Milhouse is still gonna need a true friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 592858,
      "endMs": 595793
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Someone to tell him he's great. Someone to rub lotion on him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595895,
      "endMs": 598989
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Someone he can hurl whiskey bottles at when he's feeling low.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599098,
      "endMs": 601862
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "You're right, Lise. I can suck up to him... like the religious people suck up to God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601968,
      "endMs": 606371
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Guess what, kids?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606472,
      "endMs": 609134
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "They're gonna pay us $50 a day to film some of the movie here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609241,
      "endMs": 612972
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Ah, we'll run that cable through here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 613079,
      "endMs": 615570
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Careful, now. Hey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617483,
      "endMs": 619747
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Didn't you direct Unnatural Discretion?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619852,
      "endMs": 622946
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Well, yes, I did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623055,
      "endMs": 625114
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Hoo-whee! Whoo! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625224,
      "endMs": 628387
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "You know, I never walk out of a movie, but, yuck!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628494,
      "endMs": 631463
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I've got an idea, Mr. Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631564,
      "endMs": 633896
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Why don't you get somethin' to eat from our food truck?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634000,
      "endMs": 636764
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Hey.! M-Mr. Simpson?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636869,
      "endMs": 639394
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "You've gotta give me the part of Krispy the Clown!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641641,
      "endMs": 645042
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "I'm sorry! You're wrong for the part.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 645144,
      "endMs": 647135
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "But look at my range!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647246,
      "endMs": 649612
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "I'm sorry. Krispy the Clown has been cast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654553,
      "endMs": 657351
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "But I will hire you for Angry the Clown, Silly Sailor and Dr. Clownius.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657456,
      "endMs": 661859
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "I won't let you down!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662895,
      "endMs": 665193
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Well, I might let you down on Silly Sailor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 665297,
      "endMs": 667265
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Up and atom. Up and at them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673606,
      "endMs": 677007
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Up and atom! Up and at them!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677109,
      "endMs": 679839
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Up and atom! Up and at them!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679945,
      "endMs": 681913
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682014,
      "endMs": 683914
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Hi, Milhouse! Hey, I want you to know... that I'm glad at least one of us got the part.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685051,
      "endMs": 689377
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Milhouse!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690423,
      "endMs": 692391
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "I didn't do it. I wished him well. I wished him well!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692491,
      "endMs": 695426
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Stupid dummy wasn't supposed to explode yet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697530,
      "endMs": 700124
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "There's the real Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700232,
      "endMs": 703395
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Milhouse! Hey, you're not Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705171,
      "endMs": 709164
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "No, I'm just Milhouse when he gets hurt. Ohh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709275,
      "endMs": 712733
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Okay. Let's get the real Milhouse over here, under the X-ray truck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 712845,
      "endMs": 716747
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Hi, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718918,
      "endMs": 721443
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Hey, cool, Milhouse. You get to be crushed by a truck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721554,
      "endMs": 725081
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "It sounds like more fun than it really is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725191,
      "endMs": 727785
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Hey! I- I think I'm lying on a broken bottle!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 727893,
      "endMs": 730453
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Beautiful! Use it. Okay. Fallout Boy, origin scene, take one- Action.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730563,
      "endMs": 736800
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Up and at them. Thanks for the help, mysterious stranger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738971,
      "endMs": 743032
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Say. I think those X-rays gave me super powers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743142,
      "endMs": 746543
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "And... cut.! That was perfect.! Let's do it again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746645,
      "endMs": 750809
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Uh, these aren't real X-rays, are they?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750916,
      "endMs": 753976
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Good question! We'll check into that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754086,
      "endMs": 755986
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Okay. X-ray machine to full power, and... action!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756088,
      "endMs": 759580
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Uh, sir, why don't you just use real cows?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764263,
      "endMs": 767289
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Cows don't look like cows on film. You gotta use horses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 767399,
      "endMs": 770266
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "What do you do if you want something that looks like a horse?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770369,
      "endMs": 773361
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Uh, usually we just tape a bunch of cats together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 773472,
      "endMs": 776236
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "You guys work on the movie? You're sayin' we're not working?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 776342,
      "endMs": 779106
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Oh, I always wanted to be a Teamster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 779211,
      "endMs": 781645
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "So lazy and surly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781747,
      "endMs": 783840
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Mind if I relax next to ya?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783949,
      "endMs": 788318
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807573,
      "endMs": 809473
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Oh, here he comes. What is it now, Quimby?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809575,
      "endMs": 812738
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Nothing. Nothing. Only the, uh, city has just passed... another tax on puffy directing pants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812845,
      "endMs": 818779
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "But I don't wear puffy pants!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818884,
      "endMs": 821045
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "I meant a, uh, tax on not wearing puffy pants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 821153,
      "endMs": 824316
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Oy! I'm sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824423,
      "endMs": 826414
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Wow! You've really got it made now, Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831263,
      "endMs": 833788
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "This is living! Is it, Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 833899,
      "endMs": 837096
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Is it really? Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837203,
      "endMs": 839603
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Ever since I became a movie star, I've been miserable.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839705,
      "endMs": 842799
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "I had to get up at 5:00 a. m. just for makeup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842908,
      "endMs": 845376
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "I like the way the blush brings out my cheekbones, but it's not worth it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845477,
      "endMs": 849971
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "And making movies is so horribly repetitive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 850082,
      "endMs": 853074
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "I've said \"jiminy jillickers\" so many times, the words have lost all meaning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 853185,
      "endMs": 856712
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "We've got to do the jiminy jillickers scene again, Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 856822,
      "endMs": 859723
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "But we already did it. It took seven hours, but we did it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859825,
      "endMs": 864888
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "It's done.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864997,
      "endMs": 866464
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Yes! But we've got to do it from different angles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866565,
      "endMs": 870023
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Again and again! And again and again and again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 870135,
      "endMs": 873002
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876809,
      "endMs": 880176
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Ach! I can't believe Silly Sailor beat us both up...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883282,
      "endMs": 887412
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "and imprisoned us in his floating Aquaworld. Jiminy jillickers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 887519,
      "endMs": 892149
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "There, now, there's no need for profanity, Fallout Boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892258,
      "endMs": 897025
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Everyone in town has been gouging us silly, but it's worth it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 897129,
      "endMs": 900656
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "It's all up there on the screen. Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 900766,
      "endMs": 903200
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "That Milhouse is going to be big.! Gabby Hayes big!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903302,
      "endMs": 906635
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Okay, listen up, everybody. This is the hardest... most expensive scene in the movie, and we only get one shot at it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 909808,
      "endMs": 915139
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "So we have to do it right. Fallout Boy will untie Radioactive Man... and pull him to safety... moments before he's hit with a 40-foot wall of sulfuric acid... that will horribly burn everything in its path.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915247,
      "endMs": 928091
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Now, that's real acid, so I want to see goggles, people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928193,
      "endMs": 931492
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Real acid? Okay. Roll film!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932731,
      "endMs": 937498
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Tip the acid vats.! And... action.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937603,
      "endMs": 941095
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Only Fallout Boy can save me now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945678,
      "endMs": 948476
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Where's Fallout Boy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950249,
      "endMs": 952581
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Fallout Boy! Uh-oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 955587,
      "endMs": 958454
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "My eyes. The goggles do nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965631,
      "endMs": 968532
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Where in the hell is Milhouse?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978277,
      "endMs": 980837
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "That one shot cost us a million dollars!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980946,
      "endMs": 984245
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Where's the producer? I want to talk about this coffee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984350,
      "endMs": 988514
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Milhouse!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007039,
      "endMs": 1009940
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Thanks to modern editing techniques... we can use existing footage to complete the film without Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014046,
      "endMs": 1019915
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Watch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021286,
      "endMs": 1024119
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Looks like we're in trouble, Fallout Boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024223,
      "endMs": 1028557
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Jiminy jillickers, Radioactive Man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028660,
      "endMs": 1031254
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "We'll have to fight our way out. Are you ready?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031363,
      "endMs": 1034127
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034233,
      "endMs": 1037566
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Seamless, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1039004,
      "endMs": 1041029
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "You're fired. And with good cause!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041140,
      "endMs": 1043370
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1045677,
      "endMs": 1047577
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Okay. We can all stop worrying now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047679,
      "endMs": 1050147
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "These dogs never fail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050249,
      "endMs": 1051773
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "But... will they just find Milhouse, or will they find him and kill him?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051884,
      "endMs": 1055843
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Well, they'll- When they find him, they'll, um-",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055954,
      "endMs": 1059685
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Excuse me, you didn't answer me. You just trailed off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063529,
      "endMs": 1066794
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah, I did kinda... trail off there, didn't I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066899,
      "endMs": 1070460
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "I know Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070569,
      "endMs": 1072696
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "I'll just check all his old haunts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072805,
      "endMs": 1074830
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Have you seen Milhouse? No. Now, go away. We're racing... for the title of the Champion of the Universe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079111,
      "endMs": 1083314
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "All right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086485,
      "endMs": 1087543
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Yo! Doctor \"S.\" Have you seen Milhouse today? No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093459,
      "endMs": 1096792
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Okay. Thanks. Wait.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1096895,
      "endMs": 1098795
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Did you know that there's a direct correlation... between the decline of Spirograph and the rise in gang activity?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098897,
      "endMs": 1103064
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Think about it. I will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103168,
      "endMs": 1104635
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "No, you won't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1104736,
      "endMs": 1108001
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "The only place left is the tree house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1110576,
      "endMs": 1112703
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Aha! Stay away from me, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1116915,
      "endMs": 1119383
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I mean it. I'm not going back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1119485,
      "endMs": 1121385
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "I'm not cut out to be a star. But, Milhouse... being a star is every patriotic American's dream.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121487,
      "endMs": 1127390
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Not mine. It's a sham, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127493,
      "endMs": 1129927
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "You get up on that movie screen pretending to be a hero, but you're not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130028,
      "endMs": 1134260
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "The real heroes are out there, toiling day and night on more important things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134366,
      "endMs": 1139326
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Television? No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1139438,
      "endMs": 1141770
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Curing heart disease and wiping out world hunger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141874,
      "endMs": 1144468
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "But, Milhouse, they haven't cured anything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1144576,
      "endMs": 1147306
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Heart disease and world hunger are still rampant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147412,
      "endMs": 1149710
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Those do-gooders are all a bunch of pitiful losers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1149815,
      "endMs": 1152875
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Every last one of'em! Want results?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152985,
      "endMs": 1155545
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "You have to go to the Schwarzeneggers, the Stallones... and to a lesser extent, the Van Dammes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155654,
      "endMs": 1159858
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Mickey Rooney.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163862,
      "endMs": 1165887
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Hi, Milhouse. The studio sent me to talk to you... being a former child star myself, and... the number-one box office draw from 1939 through 1940!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1165998,
      "endMs": 1176498
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Wow! Spanning two decades.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176608,
      "endMs": 1178542
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "How'd you find us? Uh, they tapped your tree house phone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178644,
      "endMs": 1182136
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Milhouse. Listen, you can't quit this movie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185450,
      "endMs": 1188681
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "I've seen your work. It's good. Very, very good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188787,
      "endMs": 1192279
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Van Johnson good. I know I'm good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192391,
      "endMs": 1195758
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Movie stardom is just so hollow. Hollow?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1195861,
      "endMs": 1198762
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "The only thing in show business that's hollow is the music industry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1198864,
      "endMs": 1202800
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Come on, Milhouse. You have to do this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202901,
      "endMs": 1205096
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "If not for yourself, then for the movie-going public... and for the foreign markets that are more important than ever nowadays.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1205204,
      "endMs": 1212406
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "And finally, for me... the Mickster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1212511,
      "endMs": 1218516
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "No! All right. I tried.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1218617,
      "endMs": 1221142
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Fortunately, we have a perfectly good Fallout Boy right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1221253,
      "endMs": 1224950
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Jiminy jillickers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1226325,
      "endMs": 1228225
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Jiminy jillickers. Jiminy jillickers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1228327,
      "endMs": 1230818
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "We're shutting down production. Yeah, well, we only have $1,000 left anyway.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1230929,
      "endMs": 1235127
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Ah, there's a $1,000 \"leaving town\" tax.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1235234,
      "endMs": 1237566
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "I hope you're all satisfied. You bankrupted a bunch of naive movie folks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1241240,
      "endMs": 1245108
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Folks from a Hollywood where values are different.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1245210,
      "endMs": 1248941
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "They weren't thinking about the money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1249047,
      "endMs": 1250947
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "They just wanted to tell a story. A story about a radioactive man... and you slick small-towners took 'em for all they were worth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1251049,
      "endMs": 1258411
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Should we give them some of their money back?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1262194,
      "endMs": 1264754
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1264863,
      "endMs": 1267696
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Hurry, Mr. Rooney. We've got a disenchanted little girl in a Jell-O Pudding commercial.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1267799,
      "endMs": 1271633
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "I could play that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1271737,
      "endMs": 1274035
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "So, Milhouse. It must be a little tough... givin' up all that glamour and comin' back to school, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1275340,
      "endMs": 1279970
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Quiet! Maybe I can get my citizenship.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1280078,
      "endMs": 1283047
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "We know you don't have any more money left.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1289121,
      "endMs": 1291487
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "But that doesn't matter. Just take whatever you need from our boutiques... until you can get back on your feet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1291590,
      "endMs": 1296953
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "Thank God we're back in Hollywood, where people treat each other right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1297062,
      "endMs": 1301328
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1362661,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 7,
    "episode": 2
  }
}
